- VideoBreakdown: viral video breakdown. The Medias array must contain exactly one element with Type set to video.
- ProductRecognition: product image information recognition. All elements in the Medias array must have Type set to image.', example='VideoBreakdown'),
  userData?: string(name='UserData', description='The custom parameters. It is a JSON string that is returned as-is in the callback result, such as newsKey. NotifyAddress is a system-reserved field for the callback URL. A callback is triggered to this URL after the job is completed.', example='{"NotifyAddress": "http://xxx.callback.url"}'),
}

